# DSC kit source of truth

## Kit probes

- Operator Live / Grow / SoftCal / SoilTest / honesty OOS lists use `KIT_PROBE_NUMBERS` from `seatModel.ts` (currently `[1, 2]`).
- `ALL_POT_NUMBERS` is for Device inventory, entity maps, and Advanced restore only — never for Live plant cards or Compose assign options.

## Chrome

- Operator UI says **Probe** / **Plant**, not Seat / POT / pot slot.
- Settings Device may keep internal `seat_id` (`pot1`…) and an Advanced restore section for probes 3–4.

## In-service

- Prefer `isPotInServiceWithFleet(n, state, fleet)` when fleet inventory is available so Root, Settings, and honesty agree.
- Bare `isPotInService` is HA-helper-only fallback.

## Do not

- Offer pot 3/4 on Compose assign, Root thereabouts, or Live kit cards.
- Synthesize Got / Need for out-of-service probes.
